invalid type: string "[Day 0, 07:09] I'm Samson, a fisherman who enjoys trying new baits and techniques, and I plan to meet Jimmy by the old willow after midday to swap baits and test their effectiveness on trout. Jimmy has been using worms from the pasture as bait and is open to trying new methods. We're planning to work on stools and a storage shelf in the workshop after fishing.", expected f64e